{"id":"n93429-1-12","stage":4,"title":"블로그 · 博客","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n93429-1-12-1","ko":"잠깐만 기다려. 블로그에 올릴 사진 좀 찍고 먹자.","zh":"稍等一下。我拍几张要发在博客上的照片，然后我们就吃吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잠깐만","meaning":"一下，暂时地","explanation":"잠깐：一下，暂时地；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"잠깐","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57313","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠깐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠깐만","audio":"/audio/c8821cc6e56a5df2a36e.mp3"}},{"text":"기다려.","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기다려","audio":"/audio/45f50f6f6dc05f2c8c0a.mp3"}},{"text":"블로그에","meaning":"博客","explanation":"블로그：博客；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"블로그","audio":"/audio/202cc44b7a897f3182e8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93429","senseId":"1","lemma":"블로그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"블로그에","audio":"/audio/5d0edc5ee9e68e899a1b.mp3"}},{"text":"올릴","meaning":"发，发上，上传","explanation":"올리다：发，发上，上传；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"올리다","audio":"/audio/ff5095d829513a79ee33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22109","senseId":"15","lemma":"올리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올릴","audio":"/audio/ba8bf18cd162b1c90efd.mp3"}},{"text":"사진","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片。","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"찍고","meaning":"拍，拍摄","explanation":"찍다：拍，拍摄；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"찍다","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63320","senseId":"6","lemma":"찍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찍고","audio":"/audio/5247a96de834c6814cc1.mp3"}},{"text":"먹자.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹자","audio":"/audio/2344faed1041c2fece65.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4e073566099677ea","term":"잠깐","zh":"一下，暂时地","audio":"/audio/4e073566099677ea5e65.mp3","entryId":"57313","definition":"在非常短暂的时间内。","pronunciation":["잠깐"]},{"id":"1f9765247406d52d","term":"기다리다","zh":"等，等待","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3","entryId":"62264","definition":"直到人、时机到来或某事完成为止，一直打发时间。","pronunciation":["기다리다"]},{"id":"202cc44b7a897f31","term":"블로그","zh":"博客","audio":"/audio/202cc44b7a897f3182e8.mp3","entryId":"93429","definition":"根据自己关心的事情而自由发布专栏、日记、照片等的网站。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"ff5095d829513a79","term":"올리다","zh":"发，发上，上传","audio":"/audio/ff5095d829513a79ee33.mp3","entryId":"22109","definition":"在计算机通讯网或互联网新闻上登载文件、文章或报道等。","pronunciation":["올리다"]},{"id":"1f872b5045690a7e","term":"사진","zh":"照片，相片","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3","entryId":"28030","definition":"为将事物的样子长久保存下来而用照相机拍下后在纸或电脑等上显现出的影像。","pronunciation":["사진"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"e1e4a89817058245","term":"찍다","zh":"拍，拍摄","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3","entryId":"63320","definition":"用照相机照射某个物品，把其样子移动到胶片上。","pronunciation":["찍따"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/8ea0d44d2dc0571aa6d1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n93429-1-12-2","ko":"이런 음식도 블로그에 올리려고?","zh":"连这种食物也要发在博客上吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이런","meaning":"这样的","explanation":"이런：这样的。","readings":[{"term":"이런","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17869","senseId":"1","lemma":"이런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이런","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3"}},{"text":"음식도","meaning":"食物，食品","explanation":"음식：食物，食品；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"2","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음식도","audio":"/audio/8a327ab7b013f2133bf8.mp3"}},{"text":"블로그에","meaning":"博客","explanation":"블로그：博客；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"블로그","audio":"/audio/202cc44b7a897f3182e8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93429","senseId":"1","lemma":"블로그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"블로그에","audio":"/audio/5d0edc5ee9e68e899a1b.mp3"}},{"text":"올리려고?","meaning":"发，发上，上传","explanation":"올리다：发，发上，上传；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"올리다","audio":"/audio/ff5095d829513a79ee33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22109","senseId":"15","lemma":"올리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올리려고","audio":"/audio/5530de832fe4b6194607.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"82a16d424583893e","term":"이런","zh":"这样的","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3","entryId":"17869","definition":"状态、样子、性质等这样的。","pronunciation":["이런"]},{"id":"2e144916046c2a6f","term":"음식","zh":"食物，食品","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3","entryId":"71114","definition":"可供人们吃喝的东西。","pronunciation":["음ː식"]},{"id":"202cc44b7a897f31","term":"블로그","zh